Compute from player: use city.randomRoadPoint near? Simpler find nearest road: x = round(px/CELL)*CELL, y=py; if |px - x| < 200. Place at x_road, y=py, angle=-PI/2. Ensure not colliding building (road, fine). This guarantees a ride.

